WEBVTT

00:00:00.716 --> 00:00:01.576
Meet Prac360:

00:00:01.576 --> 00:00:05.350
the all-in-one practice system for South African doctors.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:12.367
Diary, patients, consultations, billing, claims and accounts, with AI that takes the admin off your hands.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.202
Your day starts here.

00:00:14.202 --> 00:00:20.306
Turnover and collections, what the medical aids owe you, today's patients, and exactly what needs your attention.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.019
And it looks the way you like it.

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:28.722
Day, dusk or night, with ten themes to choose from.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.341
The diary works like your front desk.

00:00:33.341 --> 00:00:38.603
Book in seconds, and change a patient's status with one click as they arrive, go in and leave.

00:00:38.603 --> 00:00:41.290
A red marker shows who still needs to be billed.

00:00:46.477 --> 00:00:48.925
Open a patient and everything is there:

00:00:48.925 --> 00:00:53.757
medical aid, allergies, chronic medicines, visits, documents and the account.

00:00:57.178 --> 00:00:59.914
In the consultation, AI Scribe does the typing.

00:00:59.914 --> 00:01:09.462
With the patient's permission it listens and fills in the history, vital signs, diagnosis with the ICD-10 code, and the plan, while you simply talk to your patient.

00:01:15.378 --> 00:01:17.033
When you finish, you review.

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:21.052
Anything that needs a second look is listed, and one click fixes it.

00:01:21.052 --> 00:01:23.947
Nothing is signed or billed until you approve it.

00:01:27.779 --> 00:01:29.448
Signing creates the bill.

00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:36.527
Prac360 checks the codes, sends the claim to the medical aid by EDI, and shows every step until it's paid.

00:01:38.979 --> 00:01:39.487
Rejected?

00:01:39.487 --> 00:01:44.280
It tells you why in plain words, helps you fix it, and you re-send it with one click.

00:01:48.184 --> 00:01:50.634
Ask Assist anything, in your own words.

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:54.529
It answers, does the work for you, or asks when it's not sure.

00:01:59.184 --> 00:02:00.122
Or simply talk.

00:02:00.122 --> 00:02:01.871
Talk is a real conversation:

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:07.433
Assist listens, answers out loud, and you can interrupt it at any time, just by speaking.

00:02:07.433 --> 00:02:09.808
A glowing circle shows it's listening.

00:02:12.385 --> 00:02:20.128
With the patient's consent, every Prac360 doctor who treats them sees one shared file, including hospital stays and oncology.

00:02:20.128 --> 00:02:26.137
Patients manage it themselves in the Prac360 patient app, and can book any doctor in the network.

00:02:32.086 --> 00:02:34.470
Every practice gets the core system.

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.323
Then add only what you need:

00:02:36.323 --> 00:02:45.856
Assist and AI Scribe, stock and dispensing, hospital and wards, oncology, dental, the SAMA billing coach, advanced reports and priority support.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:51.708
Personal logins, two-step verification, roles and a full audit trail keep your data safe.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:54.832
And built-in training gets your whole team going fast.

00:02:55.561 --> 00:02:56.122
Prac360.

00:02:56.122 --> 00:02:58.927
Less admin, more time for your patients.

00:02:58.927 --> 00:03:01.030
Book your personal demo today.

